do CutsceneManager.disable_player_functionality()
do MusicPlayer.pause_music()
audio "res://Audio/Music/TutorialCutscene.wav" [bus="Music" loop="false"]
join CropDuster right [animation="Slide In Up" wait="true"]
CropDuster: Well, congrats, newbie. You must be doing something right if the Guild decided to give you access to the Gemstone Upgrade Station.
CropDuster: This station will give you an edge in combat by allowing you to mount Gemstones to your weapon.
CropDuster: In fact...
do CutsceneManager.send_camera_to_sword_crafting_station_pos()
[wait time="1.0" skippable="true"]
do CutsceneManager.spawn_beginner_gem_chest()
[wait time="2.0" skippable="true"]
CropDuster: Here's a little reward to appreciate all of your effort. Go ahead and break that chest open, take the contents, and access the Gem Stone Upgrade System.
[wait time="1.0"]
do CutsceneManager.enable_player_functionality()
do CutsceneManager.set_camera_to_player()
do MusicPlayer.unpause_music()